> Yes, some variances of the data are greater than others by some magnitudes. What should I do about it?

You can rescale large ones by dividing by a multiple of 10, or rescale very small ones by multiplying by a multiple of 10.

> > varTable(fit)
>             name idx nobs    type exo user    mean        var nlev lnam
> 1  mean_LEC_corr   1   74 numeric   0    0   2.304      7.315    0
> 2           Sand   7   74 numeric   0    0 333.311 156103.587    0
> 3           Silt   8   74 numeric   0    0 391.743  63920.851    0
> 4           Clay   9   74 numeric   0    0 275.649  42143.354    0
